<view class="screen">
  <view class="eyebrow">WHALEU · 反馈通知</view>
  <view class="title">公开反馈提醒</view>
  <view class="notice">只有当前获授权的超级管理员可查看本账号收到的反馈提醒。每次打开反馈都会重新核验当前帖子权限。</view>
  <view class="status" aria-role="status">{{status}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{loaded}}" class="section-title">反馈通知未读 {{unreadCount}} 条</view>
  <button bindtap="onReload" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">刷新反馈通知</button>
  <button wx:if="{{busy}}" bindtap="onCancel">停止等待</button>
  <navigator wx:if="{{!hasSession}}" class="link" url="/pages/login/login">登录后查看本账号的反馈通知 →</navigator>
  <view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="noticeId" class="card">
    <view class="meta">{{item.createdAt}} · {{item.readAt ? '已读' : '未读'}}</view>
    <view class="section-title">收到一条公开反馈</view>
    <view wx:if="{{item.available === false}}" class="meta">反馈当前不可查看；请刷新后重试</view>
    <button data-id="{{item.noticeId}}" bindtap="onOpen" disabled="{{busy || item.available === false}}">查看反馈</button>
    <button wx:if="{{!item.readAt}}" data-id="{{item.noticeId}}" bindtap="onRead" disabled="{{busy || item.available === false}}">标记此条已读</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{loaded &amp;&amp; !items.length}}" class="empty">暂无反馈通知</view>
  <button wx:if="{{canLoadMore}}" bindtap="onMore" disabled="{{busy}}">加载更多反馈通知</button>
  <view class="notice">这里只是站内通知模拟，尚未接入微信订阅消息。通知不包含作者身份或原文快照；浏览列表和打开反馈不会自动标记已读。</view>
</view>
